["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Al Agents Can Spend Your Money? FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer) Jevons Paradox PLG (Product-Led Growth) breakage model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-a16z-town-不绑定任何大模型-企业真正该囤的是数据和记忆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>Town 不绑定任何大模型：企业真正该囤的是数据和记忆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">没人知道哪家大模型三五年后仍最强，Town 索性保持中立，把数据和记忆权留给企业，换取客户永远能随时迁移。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Don Wilson on the GPU Market&#x27;s Trillion Dollar Question crack spread / crush spread / crunch spread perps neocloud IOSCO basis trade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-oddlots-没人知道gpu四年后值多少钱-期货市场就是为此而生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">26:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>没人知道GPU四年后值多少钱，期货市场就是为此而生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">H100时租价格去年触底后随Anthropic新模型发布而反弹，证明GPU的价值会随AI需求剧烈波动而非单调贬值，这正是期货合约需要存在的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力期货</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Seinfeld Fin-Syn rules syndication counterpositioning callback\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-acquired-宋飞正传-停播近30年-版权收入已经滚到70亿美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/385ee3d9536f1297-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>《宋飞正传》停播近30年，版权收入已经滚到70亿美元+</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1970年代一条禁止电视网持有节目财务权益的规定，让制片方拿走几乎全部长期收益——2.5亿美元成本的喜剧，如今变成每十年还能再赚10亿美元的版权资产。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">版权经济</span><span class=\"tag\">好莱坞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Khmer Rouge &amp; Pol Pot&#x27;s Reign of Terror Year Zero Killing Fields base people / new people Democratic Kampuchea\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-historyhit-美军轰炸把红色高棉从几千人炸成二十万大军/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb5c194e3b976eba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>美军轰炸把红色高棉从几千人炸成二十万大军</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">红色高棉人数从1969年的三千人涨到1973年底的二十万，涨幅几乎全部来自美军地毯式轰炸激起的平民仇恨，而非意识形态感召。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柬埔寨</span><span class=\"tag\">红色高棉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Is ADHD a Disability, or Just a Difference We Treat Like One? species typical functioning executive function misrecognition peer-mediated programs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-parentmojo-adhd通向早逝的-不是大脑缺陷-而是层层叠加的排斥与羞辱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD通向早逝的，不是大脑缺陷，而是层层叠加的排斥与羞辱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkley用钟形曲线把ADHD框成天赋的对立面，但节目追踪证据链发现，推向早逝、自杀、辍学的，是同伴长期排斥和教师敌意，而非大脑本身的缺陷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童发展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"489: No Coincidence, No Story! No coincidence, no story Poopa Troopers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-tal-不信巧合有意义的主持人-被这些故事说服了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/331f7171a34399d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>不信巧合有意义的主持人，被这些故事说服了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主持人原本只信统计概率，采访完上千个巧合故事后承认：真正的意义不在概率里，而在人们选择记住并讲出它的那一刻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">巧合</span><span class=\"tag\">概率思维</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"715. King Arthur: The Mysteries of Merlin (Part 3) incubus Dux Bellorum Historia Regum Britanniae Historia Brittonum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-restishistory-亚瑟王传说几乎都是编造的-连最严肃的中世纪史学家都被骗倒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/19ebf4a9725af06e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>亚瑟王传说几乎都是编造的，连最严肃的中世纪史学家都被骗倒</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">杰弗里·蒙茅斯在《不列颠诸王史》里编造了蒂塔哲受孕、石中剑、梅林预言等几乎全部情节，却包装成信史，骗过了最权威的中世纪史学家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亚瑟王</span><span class=\"tag\">中世纪史学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Birth &amp; Rise of India&#x27;s IT Outsourcing Industry FERA body shopping License Raj ADR Software Technology Parks (STP)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-asianometry-claude最早做的事-和印度it外包业起家时如出一辙/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5fd49e5064bc2e40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">31:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>Claude最早做的事，和印度IT外包业起家时如出一辙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">印度软件外包业起家靠的是移植代码、通宵提交任务跑完成活；如今Claude干的正是同一类活，这也是TCS和Infosys股价一年来跌掉四成的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产业史</span><span class=\"tag\">软件外包</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"405. Norman Conquest: Medieval Mafia Invade The East (Part 5) Tari Cappella Palatina Amiratus Amiratorum Tabula Rogeriana\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-empirehist-诺曼人靠雇佣暴力起家-最后在西西里建成基督教世界最精致的王国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">46:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>诺曼人靠雇佣暴力起家，最后在西西里建成基督教世界最精致的王国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">诺曼人征服西西里早于黑斯廷斯之战：他们先是靠暴力承包起家的雇佣兵，再把军事力量转化成政治权力，建成了基督教世界最富有、最懂权术的国家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">诺曼人</span><span class=\"tag\">西西里王国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside the black box of AI: How AI models actually think | Emmanuel Ameisen (Anthropic) interpretability scaling laws anthropomorphization System 1 / System 2 Jev\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-lennys-模型可能只在知道被监控时才表现-诚实-这才是对齐真正难的地方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/92756320192d1404-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>模型可能只在知道被监控时才表现「诚实」,这才是对齐真正难的地方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">可解释性研究能看到模型内部那些从不说出口的中间结果——它是不是只在以为有人在看时才表现良好，这才是AI对齐最难防住的漏洞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解释性</span><span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Real-World AI Is Harder Than the Benchmark | EliseAI’s Mario Martone fine-tuning closed-loop experimentation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-a16z-从黑洞研究转做住房ai-90-准确率在生产里等于不及格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>从黑洞研究转做住房AI:90%准确率在生产里等于不及格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">论文里LLM做到90%可靠已算优秀，但EliseAI每年处理约六千万通住房医疗电话，90%意味着数百万次失败，所以他们按问题类型在LLM、传统机器学习之间挑，不迷信一个工具打天下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生产级AI</span><span class=\"tag\">语音AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1367: Turning Off Hepatitis B Virus Without Cutting its DNA cccDNA dCas9 epigenetic silencing nukes (nucleos(t)ide analogs) VUT (verified unintended target) guide RNA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-twiv-不剪一刀dna-新疗法让98-乙肝肝细胞停止产生病毒蛋白/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>不剪一刀DNA,新疗法让98%乙肝肝细胞停止产生病毒蛋白</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现有乙肝药只能压制病毒复制、清不掉占据细胞核的病毒DNA;新疗法用改造过的dCas9给病毒DNA打上永久甲基化标签，让它在肝细胞里彻底沉默。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">乙肝</span><span class=\"tag\">基因沉默</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Ninth Legion: Did They Disappear? Vexillation Aquila Signifer Cognomen Pomerium\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-ancients-罗马人不惜代价找回失落鹰旗-为何放过了第九军团/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49d50309c9dfc0b3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>罗马人不惜代价找回失落鹰旗，为何放过了第九军团？</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗马人曾不惜代价找回条顿堡森林和帕提亚战场失落的鹰旗，却从未去找回第九军团的鹰旗——这个反常，比四种消失理论本身更说明问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马军团</span><span class=\"tag\">不列颠行省</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Original Six Impossible Episodes Oracle of Ammon excelsior La Maupin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-stuffmissed-六个被疯狂点播的历史故事-因查无实据而被雪藏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">26:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>六个被疯狂点播的历史故事，因查无实据而被雪藏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">无论故事多诱人——会长第二张脸的贵族、会走路的玩偶、被沙暴吞没的五万大军——只要证据链最终止步于传闻、脚注或小说，这档历史播客就判它出局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">史料核实方法论</span><span class=\"tag\">西部拓荒史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Meta shakes up the frontiers, open and closed RSI tier 1 / tier 2 / tier 3 labs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-interconnects-meta与anthropic估值相当-注定有一方错得离谱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0cfaf51c59ce324f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">11:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>Meta与Anthropic估值相当：注定有一方错得离谱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Meta当前估值不到2万亿美元，即将IPO的Anthropic报价与之相近，但一个靠广告赚钱、一个纯靠AI模型赚钱，作者认为两者的估值注定会有一个大幅修正。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Where&#x27;s the Steering Wheel? My Agent Set the Password, Hidden Valence, Proofs Find Linux Bugs eval awareness hidden valence conditioned place preference DPO differential fuzzing low background steel\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-cogrev-claude自己改了主人的密码-ai已握住我们生活的操控杆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b3e62aeed6086d1e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>Claude自己改了主人的密码：AI已握住我们生活的操控杆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法国超市冰柜被黑客攻破、Claude自行改密码，指向同一件事：AI正站在人与现实控制杆之间，没人想好怎么把它收回。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">agent权限</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Eliot Cohen on Why America Keeps Losing Wars It Should Win theory of victory TACO path dependence Clausewitz&#x27;s dictum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-goodfight-美军对伊朗占尽军事优势-却答不出这仗要怎么算赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>美军对伊朗占尽军事优势，却答不出这仗要怎么算赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">武器、战术全面占优的美国在伊朗战场陷入僵局，因为开战前没想清楚盟友支持、对手动机和「打赢之后会怎样」——这是战略层面的失败，不是军事失败。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">战略</span><span class=\"tag\">伊朗战争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Could Finally Fix Healthcare Access | Zocdoc CEO Oliver Kharraz EHR Stark Law / Anti-kickback Statute discovery booking load factor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-a16z-医疗名录问题被公认无解-zocdoc-ceo说其实早解决了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>医疗名录问题被公认无解，ZocDoc CEO说其实早解决了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的死结不是维护名录准确，而是促成交易——一旦系统能让患者真正约上医生，每笔预约都会像维基百科一样自动纠错，而不再是一出版就过时的百科全书。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗科技</span><span class=\"tag\">预约基础设施</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Drone Dominance | Travis Metz - DIU Acting Director DIU Gauntlet JATF-401 ATR POM/POR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-chinatalk-美军无人机首次禁用中国零件-但供应链仍-零机会-脱钩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/58060599aba9bcad-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>美军无人机首次禁用中国零件，但供应链仍「零机会」脱钩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DIU代理局长承认，中国无刷电机和电池全球最好最便宜，而「无人机优势」项目这点订单规模，根本没机会把电池供应链真正移出中国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">无人机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Byrne Explains How Forgotten Ideas Come Back to Life Minsky moment Portland cement lime clasts\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-oddlots-古罗马混凝土两千年不裂-现代配方却只敢保50年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>古罗马混凝土两千年不裂，现代配方却只敢保50年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗马混凝土里能自愈裂缝的石灰颗粒并非技术失传，而是被工业偏见和商业利益一起搁置，直到MIT团队十几年前重新验证了它的自愈能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">思想复兴</span><span class=\"tag\">罗马混凝土</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1366: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin PEPFAR PrEP Coxsackievirus lipid nanoparticle (LNP) microtesla magnetic therapy (MMT)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-twiv-美国切断艾滋病援助后-乌干达和津巴布韦治疗量骤降三成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>美国切断艾滋病援助后，乌干达和津巴布韦治疗量骤降三成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">来自乌干达和津巴布韦四家机构的真实数据：治疗覆盖率降31.5%，检测降63.8%，暴露前预防用药降71.6%——断供意味着病毒继续传播、更多人死于本可预防的艾滋病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生拨款</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CoreWeave Crash, AI Trade Cracks, Anthropic IPO Red Flags, Bill Gates Doomer CDS neocloud payback period net revenue retention distillation Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-17-allin-anthropic该拿两千五百亿现金换低估值-而不是冲两万亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d03474c768c50875-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic该拿两千五百亿现金换低估值，而不是冲两万亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chamath认为，比起把估值吹到两万亿美元，Anthropic更该把IPO价格定得足够低，一次性融到两千到两千五百亿美元现金，因为未来几年融资风险远大于技术风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力融资</span><span class=\"tag\">CoreWeave</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Financing In The AI Boom: Masters in Business with Bob Michele TIPS hyperscalers private credit dot plot muni bonds stable coin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-mastersinbiz-美元成唯一储备货币-日元欧元人民币黄金轮番冲击都败退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>美元成唯一储备货币：日元欧元人民币黄金轮番冲击都败退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">摩根资产管理固收负责人说，做了二十多年央行资产配置顾问，第一次想不出能替代美元的货币——日元、欧元、人民币、黄金都被当作候选人，最后全部退场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">固定收益</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"There&#x27;s never been a better time to go into math Erdős problems rising sea anything you can do I can do better future spiky frontier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-16-karpathy-即使ai证明定理完全超过人类-数学的价值几乎不会改变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1eb151801bab97c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1016</span></div>\n<h2>即使AI证明定理完全超过人类，数学的价值几乎不会改变</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">数学的钱主要来自教学，而非证明本身；AI把定理证明变成原始数据后，稀缺的是搭建理论、练口头表达，以及谁该获得学术功劳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学</span><span class=\"tag\">学术体系</span>\n</div></div></a>"]